@startuml
skin rose
start
:CommandBox asks for the completions of the text;
if () then ([the text is blank])
    :No completions;
elseif () then ([the text is one word])
    :Command words that start with it,
    or a patient ID if there are none;
elseif () then ([the last word starts with -])
    :The command's options that are not
    typed yet and can be given with them;
elseif () then ([after help])
    :Command words and window;
elseif () then ([after set])
    :Setting names, then on or off;
elseif () then ([after --id in viewappt])
    :Patient IDs that start with the word;
else ([else])
    :IdCompleter completes the ID
    that the command takes first, if any;
endif
:Show the words after a Tab key cap in the status bar;
stop
@enduml
